Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat(bi):=20add=20BI=20Financeiro=20=E2=80=94?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20managerial=20financial=20dashboard?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

New read-only analytics layer over existing financial_transactions data
(same table used by Extrato/Fluxo de Caixa/Contas Bancárias). Does not
modify any existing financial screen, rule, or data.

- New route "financial-bi" (BI Financeiro), added as first item under the
  existing Financeiro menu, wired additively in App.tsx/constants.tsx.
- src/modules/finance/bi/calculations.ts: single source of truth for every
  number in the dashboard (status/overdue rules match the ones already used
  in FinancialKpiHeaderCards.tsx; internal transfers, identified by category
  "Transferência entre Contas" or is_transfer=true, are excluded from all
  income/expense sums to avoid double counting).
- Sections: Resumo Financeiro + Filtros combináveis, Contas a Receber,
  Contas a Pagar, Contas Futuras (7/15/30/60/90d + fluxo de caixa futuro),
  Atrasados, Análise por Categoria (drill-down), Fluxo de Caixa, Tabela de
  Lançamentos (busca/ordenação/paginação), Análise Mensal, Indicadores
  Gerenciais. Every consolidated number opens a drill-down modal showing the
  underlying lançamentos.
- Uses only real categories from financial_categories (no invented
  categories) and the existing read-only supabaseService methods.

